# Skill eval loop working material — see skills/verdict-workspace/.gitignore
# for the specific rule (only evals/evals.json is tracked, everything else
# there is point-in-time, regenerable working output).

# Transient agent working material — logs, throwaway scripts, anything
# that stops mattering when the session ends. Durable notes never land
# here; they go in AGENTS.md / HANDOFF.md / .agents/ instead.
scratch/

# Harness config: the project-scope, shareable parts are committed
# (they record this repo's toolchain), the personal/machine-local ones
# are not.
.claude/settings.local.json
*.local.json
